OpenStreetMap data
------------------
The generated geometry files in data/ whose header names OpenStreetMap (at the
time of writing data/metro_geometry.py and data/longhaul_geometry.py) contain
data derived from OpenStreetMap, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors. That data is
available under the Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0
(https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/), and these files are made
available under the ODbL 1.0 as well. See https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright.
The tools that derive them (tools/derive_metro.py, tools/derive_longhaul.py,
tools/waterpath.py) are code and are covered by the Apache License.

Device types
------------
The real hardware models are fetched from the NetBox Community Device Type
Library (https://github.com/netbox-community/devicetype-library) when
02_hardware.py runs. They are not stored in this repository and are covered by
that project's own licence.
